# request: "Incident timeline for the checkout outage postmortem (all times UTC,
#  3 March): 14:02 deploy 481 reaches production; 14:05 the checkout 5xx rate hits
#  12%; 14:09 the error-rate alert pages the on-call; 14:14 SEV-2 declared and the
#  incident channel opened; 14:24 cause found, 481 halved the DB pool size; 14:31
#  deploy 481 rolled back; 14:38 error rate back at baseline, 33 minutes of impact.
#  Highlight the rollback."
type: timeline
reader: engineers reading the postmortem
width: 800
direction: down   # one row per event, time runs down
focus: e6  # "Highlight the rollback"
out: the date and time zone (3 March, UTC: in the page caption), follow-up actions, customer comms
nodes:
  t1.x: 14:02
  d1.p: ""
  e1: Deploy 481 reaches production
  t2.x: 14:05
  d2.p: ""
  e2: Checkout 5xx rate hits 12%
  t3.x: 14:09
  d3.p: ""
  e3: Error-rate alert pages the on-call
  t4.x: 14:14
  d4.p: ""
  e4: SEV-2 declared, incident channel opened
  t5.x: 14:24
  d5.p: ""
  e5: "Cause found: DB pool size halved in 481"
  t6.x: 14:31
  d6.p: ""
  e6: Deploy 481 rolled back
  t7.x: 14:38
  d7.p: ""
  e7: Error rate at baseline, 33 min of impact
edges:
  d1.p -- d2.p
  d2.p -- d3.p
  d3.p -- d4.p
  d4.p -- d5.p
  d5.p -- d6.p
  d6.p -- d7.p
